  "prefLabel": "Bea 305.02 Time Limit for Reimbursement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 305.02 Time Limit for Reimbursement. All requests for reimbursement of project expenses shall be submitted within 90 days following the close of the fiscal year in which the grant is awarded.\n\nSource. #13270, eff 9-30-21; ss by #14624, eff 7-7-26, EXPIRES: 7-7-36",
